<div class="page-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">Super Admin</span><h1>Businesses</h1><p>Create business accounts, manage access, and configure which dashboard features each business uses.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="<?=url('admin-business-form')?>">+ Add Business</a></div>
